  "content": "Context: 3. Reservation for Economically Weaker Sections (EWSs)\n\n9. Adjustment of meritorious persons.A person belonging to EWS can compete for appointment against an unreserved vacancy. Persons belonging to EWS, selected on the basis of merit and not on account of reservation are not to be counted towards the quota meant for reservation.",
